From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] propsys: serialized property storage, PropVariantToVariant results, float compare (2052)

propsys: serialized property storage, PropVariantToVariant results, float against double.

The in-memory property store answers IPersistSerializedPropStorage: it writes
its values as [MS-PROPSTORE] storages (a block per format id, each value a
size, property id and typed value) and replaces its contents from such bytes,
an empty store being no bytes at all. PropVariantToVariant makes a date of a
FILETIME, answers 39 for a class id (its text, as the tests show) and
E_OUTOFMEMORY for a type it cannot convert. PropVariantCompareEx compares a
float with a double as numbers.
